/a/des/code/eval/seed397419310/5/codegen_prompts/2.codex.log:2824:/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/5/prompt.md:116:- Rotate/mirror the object so its guide edges face the same sides as the matching frame controls.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed397419310/5/codegen_prompts/2.codex.log:2825:/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/5/prompt.md:125:Build nested square frames from a stack of horizontal color stripes.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed397419310/5/codegen_prompts/2.codex.log:2826:/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/5/prompt.md:128:- Full-width horizontal stripes of distinct non-bg colors, stacked vertically.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed397419310/5/codegen_prompts/2.codex.log:2827:/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/5/prompt.md:129:- Each stripe has uniform color and variable height (1-4 rows).\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed397419310/5/codegen_prompts/2.codex.log:2828:/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/5/prompt.md:132:- Read stripes bottom to top.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed397419310/5/codegen_prompts/2.codex.log:2829:/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/5/prompt.md:133:- Bottom stripe becomes the center solid square with side length = stripe height.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed397419310/5/codegen_prompts/2.codex.log:2830:/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/5/prompt.md:134:- Each subsequent stripe wraps the current shape with a square frame of thickness = stripe height, in that stripe's color.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed397419310/5/codegen_prompts/2.codex.log:2831:/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/5/prompt.md:136:Key insight: Stripe height doubles as both frame thickness and (for the innermost) center-square side length; output dimensions are fully determined by the stripe heights.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed397419310/5/codegen_prompts/2.codex.log:2832:/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/5/prompt.md:204:- Tile all pieces (rotations/reflections allowed) into a tight rectangle with no gaps.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed397419310/5/codegen_prompts/2.codex.log:5010:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b5ca7ac4/36/code.py:39:#    - The color swap stays binary and repeated many times: every mirrored azure copy becomes\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed397419310/5/codegen_prompts/2.codex.log:5011:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b5ca7ac4/36/code.py:40:#      red-bordered, every mirrored red copy becomes azure-bordered.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed397419310/5/codegen_prompts/2.codex.log:5026:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b5ca7ac4/36/code.py:164:    - This mirrored copy swaps only the border color: azure borders become red and red borders become azure, while the 3x3 interior remains unchanged.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
